<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Mew & Maple's practical indoor-cat living guides and editorial approach.">
  <section class="container prose-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">OUR PROJECT</p>
    <h1>Thoughtful living with indoor cats.</h1>
    <p>Mew & Maple is an English-language editorial project focused on making indoor-cat care more understandable, practical and safer for everyday households.</p>
    <h2>What we cover</h2>
    <p>Our starting subjects are indoor play and enrichment, cat-friendly small spaces, product-selection questions and routines for shared or multi-cat homes. We favor clear comparisons and decisions that can be adapted to different cats over universal shopping lists.</p>
    <h2>How we approach advice</h2>
    <p>We use veterinary and established welfare information where relevant, identify common risks and distinguish editorial artwork from product evidence. We do not claim veterinary credentials, independent product tests, or external expert review unless they have actually occurred.</p>
    <h2>Looking ahead</h2>
    <p>The project may develop its own pet accessories in the future. No product line or release date is being announced here. If a commercial relationship becomes relevant to our recommendations, it should be disclosed transparently.</p>
    <div class="notice">Before launch: add the verified publisher identity, public contact method and accountability details. This page is not publication-ready.</div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
